    {"step": 2, "tactic": "Identity Protection Risk Signal", "technique": "T1078.001", "what_happened": "Entra ID Identity Protection fired riskState=atRisk riskLevel=high riskDetection='anonymousIPAddress' for admin@corp-target.onmicrosoft.com. Source 198.51.100.66 is in Microsoft's known-VPS list. Concurrent 'tokenIssuerAnomaly' detection — client_id 1950a258 (Azure PowerShell) but UA explicitly says 'AzureAD attack sim'.", "chain_reason": "Wazuh rule 99605 'Entra ID: riskState=atRisk for global admin account' fired with rule.mitre.id=T1078.001."},
